{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00672","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 大顺舞 · 郑絪","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 大顺舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"於穆时文，受天明命。\n允恭玄默，化成理定。\n出震嗣德，应乾传圣。\n猗欤缉熙，千亿流庆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑絪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00672.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00672","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}